-## API 接口说明
-
-### 登录
-```
-POST /api/users/login
-Body: {"email": "...", "password": "..."}
-返回: {"_id": "用户ID", "nickname": "...", ...}
-```
-
-### 获取题目
-```
-GET /api/problems/{problemId}
-返回: {"_id": "...", "name": "...", "desc": "...", ...}
-```
-
-### 下载工程
-```
-GET /api/problems/{problemId}/package?userId={userId}
-返回: Zip 文件
-```
-
-### 提交代码
-```
-POST /api/submissions/submit
-Body: {
-  "problemId": "...",
-  "userId": "...",
-  "tiling_h": "...",
-  "tiling_key_h": "...",
-  "host_cpp": "...",
